      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "QlzPKrcFzf4e6wjESrpl",
      "chargedCharacters": "36"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_nettle_fight",
      "text": "Move, or be moved.",
      "characters": 18,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "3OgvF29BuqGJJdvfuQJY",
      "chargedCharacters": "8"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_selene_fire_letters",
      "text": "What did he write?",
      "characters": 18,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "W10omTsU16UhI1Aj05aE",
      "chargedCharacters": "8"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_selene_fire_warm",
      "text": "He wrote to me about you, too. Not twenty letters. But enough.",
      "characters": 62,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "vFFfXztL67kKw7ohtfRr",
      "chargedCharacters": "27"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_selene_fire_deflect",
      "text": "You should sleep. It is a long walk to the mine.",
      "characters": 48,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "2babkAQhotrd9JphrTcj",
      "chargedCharacters": "21"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_selene_fire_dorran",
      "text": "Your husband is a fortunate man.",
      "characters": 32,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "IcbSYURaIgiLiUtVXTdy",
      "chargedCharacters": "14"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_dorran_with",
      "text": "We are with you. Everyone comes out.",
      "characters": 36,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "vF7vajSyOnE2KwLA41gb",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_dorran_mission",
      "text": "The mage first. Then the slaves, if there is time.",
      "characters": 50,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "7ilajuxaflCrvsTjJC2G",
      "chargedCharacters": "22"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_durnik_paper",
      "text": "Paper and knives? How does a trading house take a dwarven mine?",
      "characters": 63,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "kNEwnH148XIH4m9xbOyD",
      "chargedCharacters": "28"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_durnik_free",
      "text": "The old ones are dead. Get up; you are with us.",
      "characters": 47,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Sf61JgDKiHd7g6JwLNwA",
      "chargedCharacters": "21"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_durnik_leave",
      "text": "Stay where you are. We will come back for you.",
      "characters": 46,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "lrTOSsI8IbbaChANrGMG",
      "chargedCharacters": "20"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_malvane_who",
      "text": "Who do you answer to? Say the name and I may let you keep your ledgers.",
      "characters": 71,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "rn7mLU2mtpiXZa5gwTQh",
      "chargedCharacters": "31"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_malvane_fight",
      "text": "Enough. We\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re freeing the prisoners.",
      "characters": 38,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "1vxW3wP45b8hzeON9lcH",
      "chargedCharacters": "17"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_flood_now",
      "text": "Turn the wheel. Now.",
      "characters": 20,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "yblMwz0xFoBeq3Cdbyof",
      "chargedCharacters": "9"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_flood_wait",
      "text": "No one touches that wheel until our friend is up. Hold this room.",
      "characters": 65,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "TDvQHioMlYQX2wv1imFT",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_vess_papers_who",
      "text": "Who are the people you answer to?",
      "characters": 33,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "7QgPTMVoC4m5hBdRNlrI",
      "chargedCharacters": "15"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_vess_papers_give",
      "text": "Copy them tonight. The originals go to the city.",
      "characters": 48,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "InkoEQaSnOmPO94DGFGH",
      "chargedCharacters": "21"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_vess_papers_refuse",
      "text": "No. And if either of you touches them, you leave this company.",
      "characters": 62,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "K5Y2SuLW3UWmC4Od1Y3I",
      "chargedCharacters": "27"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_dream_others",
      "text": "Others. How many? Who?",
      "characters": 22,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "NQ5NbDHr0AdJNwpvF9rf",
      "chargedCharacters": "10"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_dream_reject",
      "text": "I will stop him. I will not claim the murder god\u2019s throne.",
      "characters": 58,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "oFsFcWE2vTM6f6Hp0e2e",
      "chargedCharacters": "26"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7_dream_embrace",
      "text": "If there are others, I had better be the strongest.",
      "characters": 51,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "wUaBnVa4yJv9xY7ij5UZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "22"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_span_count_nineteen",
      "text": "Nineteen. I counted them out.",
      "characters": 29,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "pqXdgtmtYWTt4jLMa8wZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "13"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_span_count_many",
      "text": "Cages of them. I did not count.",
      "characters": 31,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "uPXIyxpyHED4djh1dgdk",
      "chargedCharacters": "14"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_span_count_none",
      "text": "That is between me and the Duke.",
      "characters": 32,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "RiQVjknngIsLC74p5FF4",
      "chargedCharacters": "14"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halloran_why",
      "text": "Why does the Duke want me? He does not know me.",
      "characters": 47,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "lQInQMsKMHbXG0EQ7DfS",
      "chargedCharacters": "21"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halloran_yes",
      "text": "Consider it done.",
      "characters": 17,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "h19fkeeKtd7UmpV6Hhw0",
      "chargedCharacters": "7"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halloran_pay",
      "text": "The Gauntlet pays for this, I assume.",
      "characters": 37,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "r05McUlSTHjxQhsz6DR8",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_door_faelen",
      "text": "Talk to him.",
      "characters": 12,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "CkmLC3sDvvrsLDUJnrj6",
      "chargedCharacters": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_door_wren_ward",
      "text": "Quietly.",
      "characters": 8,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "n9TWKJDRFwxRDGyT5ewK",
      "chargedCharacters": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_door_fennick",
      "text": "Pay him.",
      "characters": 8,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "AKdxOhpHa177NrhYyBVW",
      "chargedCharacters": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_door_force",
      "text": "We go through him.",
      "characters": 18,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Of1xfKKapWbuaz2kDaCu",
      "chargedCharacters": "8"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_duke_seen_nobody",
      "text": "My company, and now you.",
      "characters": 24,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "tgAa9KwX7Oum0fYa0r8s",
      "chargedCharacters": "11"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_duke_seen_hand",
      "text": "The Umbral Hand has copies. I allowed it.",
      "characters": 41,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "NBxEulkmTCrcnZvqTV3G",
      "chargedCharacters": "18"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_duke_seen_wardens",
      "text": "Wardens. Our friend from the Open Hand read them first.",
      "characters": 55,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "bUTmYbzCM0k7s0u2UGUx",
      "chargedCharacters": "24"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halvard_city",
      "text": "Then we will get them. For the city.",
      "characters": 36,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "SHdibp7YVsYEBy2ujFfA",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halvard_pay",
      "text": "For the city, and for a price.",
      "characters": 30,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "udEKHbypqRi0NRDr5IHt",
      "chargedCharacters": "13"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8_halvard_blood",
      "text": "The Consortium has been trying to kill me since Lanternhold. Why me, Duke?",
      "characters": 74,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "TnoaUYEHv2NWlPZ7ePjj",
      "chargedCharacters": "33"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lobby_talk",
      "text": "We are the company from the south. Your master sent for us before the mine flooded.",
      "characters": 83,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "zxhyj3w3AQ9c38T8qnu5",
      "chargedCharacters": "37"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lobby_fight",
      "text": "Guards first. The clerk if he runs.",
      "characters": 35,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Iwbqr3el6jrD9a5IvAKw",
      "chargedCharacters": "15"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lobby_wren_ward",
      "text": "Go and see what is on that list.",
      "characters": 32,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "x4QJhgs7jWksIRX416mD",
      "chargedCharacters": "14"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_floor_offer_library",
      "text": "His life and his library, in exchange for me.",
      "characters": 45,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "YgvfVZe06PDCMSD0EUYY",
      "chargedCharacters": "20"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_floor_offer_nothing",
      "text": "Nothing. He simply took.",
      "characters": 24,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "T5PEeOGGYhMroxBve9hz",
      "chargedCharacters": "11"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_floor_offer_price",
      "text": "Tell me what you are selling first, and I will decide what it costs.",
      "characters": 68,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "7sqeEWA24IiwlhrHvkqC",
      "chargedCharacters": "30"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lysandra_kolade",
      "text": "Who is he to this city? Say it as if I had never heard his name.",
      "characters": 64,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "jwYxbprGEkyAid6xE17P",
      "chargedCharacters": "28"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lysandra_deal",
      "text": "Talk. Quickly.",
      "characters": 14,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "5ddaqoi9Tt5LzojdKSKr",
      "chargedCharacters": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lysandra_arrest",
      "text": "You will talk to the Duke. In chains.",
      "characters": 37,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "jzGJV6c29UuGoHIqBO9y",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9_lysandra_kill",
      "text": "You share his bed. You share his end.",
      "characters": 37,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "ZQt9LzywH6OgBY7aFN65",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_sarn_take",
      "text": "If it was my father\u2019s, I want it back.",
      "characters": 38,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "lwpRZo0Vp7oB35dyGnJN",
      "chargedCharacters": "17"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_sarn_refuse",
      "text": "Keep it. I have not decided whether to trust you.",
      "characters": 49,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "w336496cClqTAe5TaSle",
      "chargedCharacters": "22"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_sarn_threat",
      "text": "If this is a trick, I will find you.",
      "characters": 36,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Mflq9lV67UiB9GaELMlR",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_gate_where_road",
      "text": "The Griffon Road, the night we left. He stood between me and the man who killed him.",
      "characters": 84,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "ftupmEDc9BTrwk7GkZjz",
      "chargedCharacters": "37"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_gate_where_refuse",
      "text": "Write \"on the road.\" It is all you need.",
      "characters": 40,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "kLoLRZx2928C4eROSNgi",
      "chargedCharacters": "18"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_summit_kill",
      "text": "You paid for the mines and the bandits. You will not leave this room alive.",
      "characters": 75,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "moaO5pQl4hmdtEOhvJF2",
      "chargedCharacters": "33"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_summit_talk",
      "text": "I will not kill you. Tell me what your son has been doing.",
      "characters": 58,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "lljpoLZMhG0Qgj9HEWpU",
      "chargedCharacters": "26"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_summit_arrest",
      "text": "You will answer to the Duke. All three of you. Nobody dies in a library.",
      "characters": 72,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "9pCt8expRFidbL6XtuUg",
      "chargedCharacters": "32"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_end_proud",
      "text": "That he had been proud of me every day since he carried me through the gate.",
      "characters": 76,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "eyA9tD7yqGQ9eZV00FNl",
      "chargedCharacters": "33"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_end_run",
      "text": "Only \"run.\" And two names.",
      "characters": 26,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "vhN0dUlvb2FiYi5qWUGZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "11"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_end_nothing",
      "text": "I did not hear. I was doing as I was told.",
      "characters": 42,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Jes86vaV1yIl8J37oxZp",
      "chargedCharacters": "18"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_grief",
      "text": "He raised a monster and loved it anyway.",
      "characters": 40,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "06gnRmdCWswCPkSlr1iZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "18"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_anger",
      "text": "Twenty years and he never said a word. He should have told me.",
      "characters": 62,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "3GBFFPhoGCGMTzkNeDqO",
      "chargedCharacters": "27"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_letter_hunger",
      "text": "A throne. And a brother sitting in my seat.",
      "characters": 43,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Gfffp5gFLQabKFADBd92",
      "chargedCharacters": "19"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_double_strike",
      "text": "Wrong voice. Strike first.",
      "characters": 26,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "0BpPAS0Pfx9l2OQuld7v",
      "chargedCharacters": "11"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_double_strike_alone",
      "text": "Wrong voice. Strike first.",
      "characters": 26,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "4SvvsK6YyrKSFaXmr6i1",
      "chargedCharacters": "11"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_double_question",
      "text": "What did I steal from the brothers' kitchen when I was nine?",
      "characters": 60,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "hWhVcrgG8rJ6SLcsDHAy",
      "chargedCharacters": "26"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_double_listen",
      "text": "...Come here, then. Slowly.",
      "characters": 27,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "1OF5W6OdNCSlWd6W3aFj",
      "chargedCharacters": "12"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_dream_reject",
      "text": "Starve it. I will stop him as myself.",
      "characters": 37,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "b5Pg5aOajUcfvoHZgUUZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "16"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10_dream_embrace",
      "text": "If it takes a god to stop a god, then feed it.",
      "characters": 46,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Rs1ADJ2yWkEqRKv1EmnB",
      "chargedCharacters": "20"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_allegiance_gauntlet",
      "text": "We find the Duke and we save him. We do this lawfully.",
      "characters": 54,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "fcYA8x8aUUPVMEKYjxQZ",
      "chargedCharacters": "24"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_allegiance_consortium",
      "text": "The Consortium. His head for her trading house. I can live with that.",
      "characters": 69,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "0HwmCWWX4X0E9RAa0pTk",
      "chargedCharacters": "30"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_allegiance_thieves",
      "text": "The thieves. A debt is cheaper than a Duke.",
      "characters": 43,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "fuLHQOmOfMZ9vRMTcOjf",
      "chargedCharacters": "19"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_loved_yes",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "characters": 4,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "ucVyrRTEk08ZWAeZvXRi",
      "chargedCharacters": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_loved_tesfaye",
      "text": "I loved a man who lied to me for twenty years. Does that count?",
      "characters": 63,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "rmzX0r5r2J3xpgPokEX4",
      "chargedCharacters": "28"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_loved_no",
      "text": "No. And I do not intend to start.",
      "characters": 33,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "7JSx9kLL2AlJXk1hXYKy",
      "chargedCharacters": "15"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_how",
      "text": "How does one stop a man like that without killing him?",
      "characters": 54,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "MSpzoij1DPsOVxlxbOLL",
      "chargedCharacters": "24"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_promise",
      "text": "If it can be done without killing him, I will do it that way. You have my word.",
      "characters": 79,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "unSkUbVFQp2Z09Sl1Wo7",
      "chargedCharacters": "35"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_refuse",
      "text": "He killed my father. He dies.",
      "characters": 29,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "5qY1k3S2ci9nKK03wCcw",
      "chargedCharacters": "13"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11_amara_lie",
      "text": "Of course. You have my word.",
      "characters": 28,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "9bLPTrgS91G1qEySukiy",
      "chargedCharacters": "12"
    },
    {
      "id": "q12_dukes_orlan",
      "text": "The man first. He is the one with the sword.",
      "characters": 44,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "v3r5YFx9wmck5M5NgBn2",
      "chargedCharacters": "19"
    },
    {
      "id": "q12_dukes_mira",
      "text": "The woman first. She is the one who will believe us.",
      "characters": 52,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "hx6qao8jVkv4sr7Chq7P",
      "chargedCharacters": "23"
    },
    {
      "id": "q12_dukes_korvath",
      "text": "Neither. Our enemy. Now, while he is on the dais.",
